    "description": "A promotional piece for the JPMorgan Singapore & Asia Equity Income Fund, featuring a pineapple rolling through a house as a visual device to guide viewers through the fund’s core features.\n\nI was responsible for the early storyboard development, the complete 3D execution in Blender, and all post-production, including editing and final color grading.\n\nIn the end it was very well received and even got onto places that wasn't planned for at first, like their website for the fund https://am.jpmorgan.com/sg/en/asset-management/per/funds/saei/.\n\nIt was also shown in OneRafflePlace's screens and a derivative version in the 10k screen on the Downtown line.",
