    "_id": "7cbc83f8-b6dd-4ba0-8345-4d74de7530fe",
    "_type": "portfolioItem",
    "body": null,
    "description": "An immersive, exploratory web experience for prospective students, created for SIT Open House 2026. The goal was to build a functional, navigable “world” that felt lively, approachable, and engaging, while staying within real-time performance constraints on the web.\n\nI led art direction and, together with one other 3D artist, modeled and textured the characters, environment, and props. I also rigged and animated the characters.\n\nBuilt with Three.js, the project required extensive optimization to run smoothly on mobile. Leveraging low-poly assets, instancing, and strategic mesh merging, alongside ongoing troubleshooting throughout production.\n\nThe website has won website of the day and best in all categories from CSS Design Awards. It has also won FWA of the day by The FWA.\n\nCreated in collaboration with Hei and Singapore Institute of Technology.",
    "excerpt": null,
